		LockedNodeHint: Research {0} at the Research Altar to light up this skill
		EquipBtn: Equip
		UnequipBtn: Remove
		SelectBtn: Select
		SelectedTag: Active
		LoadoutFullHint: Loadout is full
		UnlockFishLine: Research source: {0}
		AltarTitle: Research Altar
		AltarHint: Click the altar to pick a researchable fish from your inventory to study.
		StudyPickerTitle: Commit to Research
		StudyPickerCount: Researchable Fish · {0}
		StudyPickerHint: Click a fish to place it into the altar for research
		StudyPickerEmpty: No researchable fish in your inventory
		StudyPlaceHint: Click to place into the Research Altar
